StructuralRule.Notes:
CERT: SER01-J
To find methods breaking the signature:
private void readObject(java.io.ObjectInputStream in)
        throws IOException, ClassNotFoundException;
Note: will allow protected in case abstract class

6.10 version contains isBodyAvailable

